  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "有效對話的跨文化實踐",
    "sub_ename": "CROSS-CULTURAL PRACTICES FOR EFFECTIVE CONVERSATION",
    "describe_ch": "為了提升英語為第二語言學習者在日常交際中跨文化差異的敏感度，本課程旨在培養學生有效參與實際對話的能力。課程將採用任務導向教學法，將教授內容與生活實際經歷建立連結，以確保所學到的會話技能能滿足不同學生的學習需求。同時不斷增進學生對不同文化偏好和認知的敏感度，本課程最適合中高級以上英語口語能力較佳的學生。",
    "describe_eh": "By heightening L2 English speakers’ sensitivity to cross-cultural differences in everyday verbal communicative practices, this course aims to develop the learners’ ability to effectively engage in real-world conversations. A task-based approach will be employed to create concrete links between what is taught and what is actually experienced, thus ensuring that target conversational skills are unique to the individual needs of the speakers in conjunction with their ever-increasing awareness of the cultural preferences of their interlocutors. This course is particularly suited for upper-intermediate to advanced levels of English spoken proficiency.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
